Third-Party Components

This app also includes the following open-source libraries, each under its own license:

- LibreHardwareMonitorLib (github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor)
  Mozilla Public License 2.0. Used to read live GPU load/temperature/voltage sensors in the
  System Monitor widget. Full license text: mozilla.org/MPL/2.0

- NAudio / NAudio.Wasapi (github.com/naudio/NAudio)
  MIT License. Used for WASAPI loopback capture and FFT in the Audio Visualizer widget.

- Microsoft.Web.WebView2 (Microsoft Edge WebView2 SDK)
  Used to render the video-based Wallpaper Studio backgrounds.

- .NET / Windows Forms runtime
  MIT License, (c) .NET Foundation and contributors.

- DesktopFences / Desktop Fences + (github.com/limbo666/DesktopFences)
  MIT License, (c) 2025 LIMBO666 (includes code originally by HakanKokcu, BirdyFences, MIT). DeskContainers
  features such as Chameleon, Peek Behind, auto-hide, backup, import/export and SpotSearch are ported from it.
  Full notice: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

----------------------------------------------------------------------

Weather data is fetched at runtime from the free Open-Meteo API (open-meteo.com) and, as a fallback,
wttr.in (github.com/chubin/wttr.in) - both used without an API key, no personal data is sent beyond
the requested coordinates/city name.
